    "text": "By WCAX News Team ,\n6 hours ago MONTPELIER, Vt. (WCAX) - The northbound lanes of Interstate 89 were closed in Montpelier because of a crash on Wednesday evening. The closure is just north of Exit 8. A WCAX News crew at the scene said the three-vehicle crash involved an auto parts truck, a pickup and a car. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
